# lms/ — learning management system stories

This directory is the canonical feature-story home for learning-management behavior. It inherits
the parent a2o story-review gate. Keep filesystem references system-scoped (`features/lms/`) while
retaining pillar vocabulary where the scenario actually names the Lamad product surface.
